<title>UK: GMAC to launch $500 million five-year bond.</title>
<headline>GMAC to launch $500 million five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>General Motors Acceptance Corp plans to launch a $500 million five-year Euro-Asian bond, HSBC Markets and Paribas said on Tuesday as joint lead managers.</p>
<p>The deal will be launched in Asia on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Price talk is 40 basis points  over the when-issued five-year U.S. Treasury note.</p>
<p>-- Dan Lalor, London newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
